i>\r\n \t<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Dr. Rachmawan Budiarto, S.T., M.T. </span></li>\r\n \t<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Ari Bimo Prakoso, S.T., Ph.D.</span></li>\r\n \t<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Ayodya Pradhipta Tenggara, S.T., M.Sc., Ph.D.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nContact Person : <span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Dr. Eng. Mohammad Kholid Ridwan, S.T., M.Sc.</span>\r\n<h2></h2>\r\n<h2>C. <b>Sustainable Nuclear Energy</b><b>  </b></h2>\r\nMain research topic : <strong><em>Green Energy System</em></strong>\r\n\r\nSubtopic: <strong><em>New Energy Resources</em></strong>\r\n<h3>Researchers:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n \t<li style=\"font-weight: 400\">Dr. Ir. Andang Widi Harto, M.T. (Chair)</li>\r\n \t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Dr.-Ing. Sihana</span></li>\r\n \t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Dr. Ir. Alexander Agung, S.T., M.Sc.</span></li>\r\n \t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Yanuar Ady Setiawan, S.T., M.S.</span></li>\r\n \t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Ir. Haryono Budi Santosa, M.Sc.</span></li>\r\n \t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Dr. -Ing. Kusnanto</span></li>\r\n \t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Muhammad Rizki Oktavian, S.T., M.S.E.</span></li>\r\n \t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Andhika Yudha Prawira, S.T., MS.</span></li>\r\n \t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Dr. Widya Rosita, S.T., M.T.</span></li>\r\n \t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Ir. Ester Wijayanti, M.T.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nContact Person : Ir. Andang Widi Harto, M.T.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h2>D. Disaster Mitigation and Data Communication</h2>\r\nMain research topic : <strong><em>Hazard and Risk Management</em></strong>\r\n\r\nSubtopic: <strong><i>Advanced Early Warning System</i></strong>\r\n<h3>Researchers:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n \t<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Prof. Ir. Sunarno, M.Eng., Ph.D., IPU. (Chair)</span></li>\r\n \t<